          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa waxaa u yimid nin baras leh, wuuna jilba joogsaday oo baryay, oo ku yidhi, Haddaad doonaysid waad i daahirin kartaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Ciise u naxariistay, oo intuu gacantiisa soo taagay, ayuu taabtay oo ku yidhi, Waa doonayaa ee daahirsanow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkiiba baraskii waa ka baxay, oo wuu daahirsanaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciisena aad buu u xukumay, oo markiiba ayuu iska diray, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo ku yidhi, Ninna waxba ha kala hadlin, laakiin tag oo wadaadka istus. Waxaad daahirsanaantaada u bixisaa wixii uu Muuse amray, marag iyaga ha u ahaatee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin wuu baxay oo bilaabay inuu aad u naadiyo oo warka faafiyo, taas aawadeed kol dambe Ciise magaaladuu bayaan u geli kari waayay, laakiin wuxuu joogay dibadda ee meelo cidla ah, meel kastana waa looga yimid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
